  "description": "The measurement presents the differential production cross\u2011section of\u202f\\(Z\\) bosons in proton\u2011proton collisions at a centre\u2011of\u2011mass energy of \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).  The independent variables are the transverse momentum of the \\(Z\\) boson, \\(p_T\\) (in\u202fGeV), binned as 5\u201310,\u202f10\u201320,\u202f20\u201330,\u202f30\u201350 and\u202f50\u201380\u202fGeV, and the rapidity, \\(y\\), sampled at the five points 0.0,\u202f0.5,\u202f1.0,\u202f1.5 and\u202f2.0 (unitless).  The observable reported is the differential cross\u2011section \\( \\mathrm{d}\\sigma/\\mathrm{d}p_T \\) with units of pb\u202f/\u202fGeV.\n\nThe results for each \\(p_T\\) bin are:  \n\n- 5\u201310\u202fGeV: \\(15.2\\;\\text{pb/GeV}\\)\u202f\u00b1\u202f0.9\u202f(pb/GeV) (statistical)\u202f\\({}^{+1.3}_{-1.1}\\)\u202f(pb/GeV) (systematic);  \n- 10\u201320\u202fGeV: \\(9.8\\;\\text{pb/GeV}\\)\u202f\u00b1\u202f0.6\u202f(pb/GeV) (statistical)\u202f\\({}^{+1.0}_{-0.8}\\)\u202f(pb/GeV) (systematic);  \n- 20\u201330\u202fGeV: \\(4.3\\;\\text{pb/GeV}\\)\u202f\u00b1\u202f0.3\u202f(pb/GeV) (statistical)\u202f\\({}^{+0.5}_{-0.4}\\)\u202f(pb/GeV) (systematic);  \n- 30\u201350\u202fGeV: \\(1.7\\;\\text{pb/GeV}\\)\u202f\u00b1\u202f0.2\u202f(pb/GeV) (statistical)\u202f\\({}^{+0.3}_{-0.3}\\)\u202f(pb/GeV) (systematic);  \n- 50\u201380\u202fGeV: \\(0.6\\;\\text{pb/GeV}\\)\u202f\u00b1\u202f0.1\u202f(pb/GeV) (statistical)\u202f\\({}^{+0.2}_{-0.2}\\)\u202f(pb/GeV) (systematic).  \n\nThese values correspond to the specified rapidity points and fully describe the measured spectrum."
